stateDiagram-v2
  state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
  state "CONSUMED" as CONSUMED
  state "EXPIRED" as EXPIRED

  [*] --> ACTIVE : Issue token (login / register / send code / forgot password)
  ACTIVE --> CONSUMED : Refresh token rotated [replacedById set]
  ACTIVE --> CONSUMED : Logout / password reset revokes refresh token
  ACTIVE --> CONSUMED : Email verified / password reset with code
  ACTIVE --> CONSUMED : New code sent [old unused code invalidated]
  ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : expiresAt passed (refresh 7d, email code 24h, reset code 1h)
  CONSUMED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
